ss=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w662b8997090e1-1-2-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-icon panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"5\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-icon so-widget-sow-icon-default-6c9c1c953d98\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-icon-container sow-icon\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"sow-icon-fontawesome sow-fas\" data-sow-icon=\"&#xf559;\"\n\t\t \n\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-w662b8997090e1-1-2-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"6\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h4 style=\"text-align: center; color: #000\">Committed to the<br \/>\nlegal profession<\/h4>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-w662b8997090e1-2\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w662b8997090e1-2-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w662b8997090e1-2-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-icon panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"7\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-icon so-widget-sow-icon-default-6c9c1c953d98\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-icon-container sow-icon\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"sow-icon-fontawesome sow-fas\" data-sow-icon=\"&#xe4f7;\"\n\t\t \n\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-w662b8997090e1-2-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"8\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h4 style=\"text-align: center; color: #000\">A business that cares about<br \/>\nthe well-being of its employees<\/h4>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-724-2\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-724-2-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-724-2-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"2\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><p>Our mission at Franco Munoz Law Firm is to provide compassionate and skilled legal representation to injured workers in the pursuit of justice. We understand that a workplace injury can have a devastating impact on an individual and their family, and we are dedicated to helping our clients navigate the often complex and overwhelming workers' compensation system.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-1046 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/steve-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"299\" height=\"302\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/steve-2.jpg 299w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/steve-2-297x300.jpg 297w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 299px) 100vw, 299px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 299px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 299\/302;\" \/>As experienced attorneys, we are committed to using our knowledge and expertise to achieve the best possible results for our clients. We believe that every injured worker deserves fair and just compensation for their injuries, and we strive to make sure that our clients receive the medical care and financial support they need to recover and move forward with their lives.<\/p>\n<p>At Franco Munoz Law, we are proud to be a part of the Bay Area community and are dedicated to giving back through our commitment to service. We believe in the importance of integrity and strive to always act with the highest ethical standards in all of our dealings.<\/p>\n<p>Ultimately, our goal is to provide the best service possible to our clients and to be a trusted resource for those seeking justice and fair treatment under the law. If you or a loved one has been injured on the job, we encourage you to reach out to us for a free consultation. We are here to listen and to help you get the compensation and support you deserve.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-726 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Success-3-scaled-1-1024x408.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"408\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Success-3-scaled-1-1024x408.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Success-3-scaled-1-300x120.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Success-3-scaled-1-768x306.jpg 768w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Success-3-scaled-1.jpg 1500w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/408;\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Our mission is to advocate for the rights of injured workers and help them obtain the benefits they deserve under the law. We are dedicated to providing compassionate and skilled legal representation to our clients, and we strive to achieve fair and just resolutions to their workers' compensation claims. We are committed to fighting for the rights of injured workers and ensuring that they receive the medical care and financial support they need to recover and move forward with their lives.<\/p>\n<p>Our top priorities in every case are to deliver excellent service and achieve the best possible outcomes. To achieve these goals, we start by getting to know our clients and thoroughly understanding their cases. We work closely with our clients as a team to provide the highest level of service and achieve the best results. Our clients are always the most valuable members of our team of experienced professionals. For a free consultation, please call us at 510-257-4141.<\/p>\n<p><strong>PERSONALIZED SERVICE<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>At Franco Munoz Law Firm, we treat each of our clients like family and understand that every case is unique. We pride ourselves on providing personalized service tailored to the needs and concerns of each individual client and their case. Our high rate of return clients and client referrals is a testament to the exceptional service we provide.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-1044 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/rene-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"299\" height=\"302\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/rene-2.jpg 299w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/rene-2-297x300.jpg 297w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 299px) 100vw, 299px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 299px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 299\/302;\" \/>We understand that every case is different, even if they may seem similar in certain aspects. We carefully review and study each case to understand and capture the differences that are important to the proper handling and resolution of the case. We also take the time to assess the concerns of each client on a regular basis to ensure that we are addressing all of their needs and providing them with the best service possible.<\/p>\n<p>At Franco Munoz Law Firm, we are committed to achieving the best results for our clients. If you have any questions or would like a free consultation, please don't hesitate to call us at 510-257-4141.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-724-2-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-724-2-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce pane